# Template for scan/.env. Copy to scan/.env and fill in. Safe to commit.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase — project "barn", created 2026-08-07
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co

# Optional parcel input CSV. Relative paths are resolved from this scan/ directory.

# Publishable (anon-equivalent) key. Safe client-side; grants nothing without
# RLS plus a signed-in session.
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<publishable key>

# REQUIRED for the scanners. They write to bills/parcels, which RLS only allows
# for the service role — with the publishable key above every write silently
# returns zero rows. Get it from:
#   https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/ndjqmzfqifafsuygdqdz/settings/api-keys
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research / enrichment APIs (all optional; each scanner degrades if absent)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=          # Gemini research + Street View Static API
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=      # Kimi K2.5 for cyber_research_agent.py
# SCRAPER_API_KEY=         # ScraperAPI, Cloudflare-heavy sources

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scan tuning
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The county tax site allows ~15 lookups/min per IP; see README "Scan speed".
# VPT_LOOKUP_INTERVAL_SEC=5
# VPT_MAX_WORKERS=1
# VPT_RECHECK_DAYS=30
# SUPABASE_RETRY_ATTEMPTS=3
